<td><a id="apply-now-link-dual" href="https://www.opencccapply.net/gateway/apply?cccMisCode=221" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apply Now</a></td>
<td><a href="https://www.ltcc.edu/admissions/campustours.php">Visit LTCC's Campus</a></td>
